    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alebound is my first indie game, built solo over 2 months. It\u2019s a wave survival game with goofy powerups and fast combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alebound is a fast-paced, wave-based action brawler where you play as a battle-hardened dwarf, wielding fists of fury and drunken might. Unleash devastating melee combos and harness ale-fueled power-ups to crush relentless waves of monsters. Survive as long as possible, upgrade your abilities, and crush your enemies in this chaotic, beer-soaked brawl!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alebound is my first indie game, built solo over 2 months. It\u2019s a wave survival game with goofy powerups and fast combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alebound is a fast-paced, wave-based action brawler where you play as a battle-hardened dwarf, wielding fists of fury and drunken might. Unleash devastating melee combos and harness ale-fueled power-ups to crush relentless waves of monsters. Survive as long as possible, upgrade your abilities, and crush your enemies in this chaotic, beer-soaked brawl!</p>",
